      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CINTA'S ME MUM (2) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (18.35) last time in a Grade 6 at this track. The form out of last race has been strong. Better than last start and can bounce back. CANTARA GYPSY (8) missed the frame latest but had been racing well prior to that including a Maiden win two back (18.29) at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. ESKIMO RUBY (7) did a good job to finish second last time out over 305m at this track (18.15) in a TG1-4W, the second top-three finish on the trot. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Something for the Multiples: SLOVAKIA (4)",
